  github -->|OIDC / exact subject and audience| sts[AWS STS CI role]
  sts -->|PutObject reports prefix only| reports
  lambda[Reporting Lambda / execution role] -->|GetObject reports prefix only| reports
  entra -.->|Sign-in and audit telemetry| monitoring[Separate security monitoring and retention]
  catalog -.->|Azure diagnostics| monitoring
  reports -.->|Configured CloudTrail S3 data events| monitoring
  recovery[Independent emergency recovery] -.->|Monitored runbook; exceptional authorization| entra
